{
    "_notes": "init: 0x0940 (reset, then 10 ms), 0x0903 (SpO2 mode Red+IR), 0x085f (4 sample avg, FIFO rollover, FIFO Int 17), 0x00=r1 (clear INT), 0x0A27 (100 samples/s, 18 bit), 0x0c4040 (LED1 and LED2 12.6mA), 0x1121 (slots). Poll: WR_PTR, OVF_COUNTER, RD_PTR, then up to 8 samples (6 bytes each) from FIFO_DATA. Samples are 18 bits. Also matches MAX30102/MAX30105 (same part ID), compatible in SpO2 mode",
